<p>I genuinely thank you for your input. I understand the dialogue is the weakest part of the article, and it has taken a considerable amount of effort and revisions to get it to where it is now (even though it is still unsatisfactory). For example, look at the last parts of Revision 12 on my sandbox page: <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/ooblex">http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/ooblex</a></p>
