<p>OK, that is fine. I would like to again thank you for the effort you have put in to help me through the revision process. I really appreciate it.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>especially if you choose to ignore the advice of multiple established authors giving you the same advice</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I know that it seems like I am completely ignoring the advice I have received since I have published this, but I have simply been too busy in the past couple of days to sit down and get cracking. You might not believe me, but it is the truth. I would like to apologize.</p>
