Is it? Is the origin of -1 common and overused in some way? I honestly cannot recall ever reading of an ancient individual transferring his mind into a rock in the lower mantle to escape an apocalypse. Care to provide an example where this concept has been used?</p>
<p>So. What I think I might do is change the log completely. Honestly, this will probably sever any connection to 1050. I would take out the footnote on the language pretty easily as well. Is this OK with you? I am not going to like it, and it is not happening any time soon due to reasons beyond my control.</p>
<p>Anyway, it will likely be a few days until any major edits can be done, as I will not have access to my computer for nine days or so. I could try using my iPad, but it is much clunkier and will not be as effective as my computer. Sorry.</p>
